From 1a09e2e25809b83277013f3d1a4bc37adf08091c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mlgprorektm8 <67933lance@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 12:24:21 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] PERF-125, DIAG-121: command-thread spin switch, selection
 sub-timers

SHADGT_CMD_SPIN sets the command thread's spin before sleeping (default 2048;
0 and 256 were not faster). DIAG-121 phases sel-flatten and sel-spec time
RefreshFlatBuf and StageSpecialization during program matching (~120-150 ms
each per 2 s on the decoder in the Tokyo race).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/common/perf_monitor.cpp                         |  2 +-
 src/common/perf_monitor.h                           |  2 ++
 .../renderer_vulkan/vk_pipeline_cache.cpp           | 13 +++++++++----
 src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_scheduler.cpp     |  8 +++++++-
 4 files changed, 19 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

